OL,3,ALords call for AI 'kill switch' powers
OL,4,Ain UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of peers is calling for the
OL,7,FBritish government to be able to
OL,8,Fdeactivate powerful AI systems and
OL,9,Fswitch off the country's data centres
OL,10,Fin the event of the tech posing a
OL,11,Fthreat to national security.
OL,13,FIt is led by the Liberal Democrats'
OL,14,FLord Tim Clement-Jones, who has
OL,15,Fproposed the measure as an amendment to
OL,16,Fthe Cyber Security and Resilience Bill
OL,17,Fwhich is currently making its way
OL,18,Fthrough Parliament.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788376771
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ALords call for AI 'kill switch' powers
OL,4,Ain UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said it would enable the building of
OL,7,Fa "vital safety net" and provide a
OL,8,Fdemocratically accountable means to
OL,9,F"halt a runaway system before it can
OL,10,Fcompromise our critical national
OL,11,Finfrastructure".
OL,13,FHe added the tool would only ever be
OL,14,Fused as a last resort.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
